/*
 * First source-derived Minecraft 1.0 terrain frame.
 *
 * RenderBlocks geometry/UV order is translated to NARM's projected textured
 * quads. terrain.png has already been decoded to RGB332 by the host packer;
 * this module only reads that converted payload. Unsupported presentation
 * layers remain explicit rather than being replaced with invented behavior.
 */

